  "title": "Caregiver perspectives on creating possibilities for loved ones living with SMA",
  "summary": "Scholar Rock recently sat down with the caregivers of loved ones living with spinal muscular atrophy (SMA), who shared their hopes for the future. Their perspectives shed light on the possibilities they envision for their loved ones – from living independently to pursuing fulfilling, passionate careers. Each voice reflects our commitment to championing what matters […]",
